WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:07.480 --> 00:00:10.750
Hey youtubers it’s charlie and it’s time
for my breakdown of his last vow.

00:00:10.750 --> 00:00:11.850
Thank you for your patience.

00:00:11.850 --> 00:00:16.090
These videos are a lot of fun to do so I try
to take extra time to make them better.

00:00:16.090 --> 00:00:18.930
If you’re finding me for the first time
or you haven’t seen any of my other sherlock

00:00:18.930 --> 00:00:22.650
episode breakdowns this will just be a shot
by shot analysis of references to the canon

00:00:22.650 --> 00:00:25.289
or other things like doctor who.

00:00:25.289 --> 00:00:27.680
Careful for the east wind if you haven’t
seen the episode yet.

00:00:27.680 --> 00:00:28.680
I mean spoilers.

00:00:28.680 --> 00:00:29.680
Careful for spoilers.

00:00:29.680 --> 00:00:32.390
Here we go, number 1 - the director nick hurran.

00:00:32.390 --> 00:00:35.470
Hurran also directed the doctor who 50th anniversary
episode.

00:00:35.470 --> 00:00:36.870
The Day of the doctor.

00:00:36.870 --> 00:00:38.980
2 - Charles augustus maunussen.

00:00:38.980 --> 00:00:42.120
He’s a direct reference to charles augustus
milverton.

00:00:42.120 --> 00:00:46.390
He was doyles master blackmailer and a few
of maunussen’s character traits are taken

00:00:46.390 --> 00:00:50.920
directly from the book character like his
glasses and creepily affable nature.

00:00:50.920 --> 00:00:53.360
3 - Notice the heads up display.

00:00:53.360 --> 00:00:57.620
This isn’t a canon reference, but it is
the worst google glass ad ever.

00:00:57.620 --> 00:01:01.469
and Later we find out it has nothing to do
with the glasses, but cybernetic implants.

00:01:01.469 --> 00:01:03.840
I guess that makes him part cyberman.

00:01:03.840 --> 00:01:05.880
4 - Speaking of doctor who.

00:01:05.880 --> 00:01:07.020
Notice the woman he’s scanning.

00:01:07.020 --> 00:01:10.670
That’s lindsay duncan who played adelaide
brooke in waters of mars.

00:01:10.670 --> 00:01:14.040
Later she even remarks at how wet maunussen’s
hands feel.

00:01:14.040 --> 00:01:16.260
5 - Notice CAMs license plate.

00:01:16.260 --> 00:01:18.700
It almost looks like it says I Can.

00:01:18.700 --> 00:01:22.580
During the episode CAM states that he does
things just because he can.

00:01:22.580 --> 00:01:24.360
6 - clair de la lune.

00:01:24.360 --> 00:01:29.180
The perfume serves as connective tissue between
lady smallwood, CAM, Mary and Sherlock.

00:01:29.180 --> 00:01:35.600
It’s french for light of the moon. and was
a lullably with a very sexual double entendre.

00:01:35.600 --> 00:01:39.890
7 - the man with the twisted lip.

00:01:39.890 --> 00:01:43.860
This is an easy one but starting from the
beginning, a woman comes to visit mary looking

00:01:43.860 --> 00:01:46.170
for her son issac whitney.

00:01:46.170 --> 00:01:47.540
Watson thinks it’s her husband.

00:01:47.540 --> 00:01:49.810
In the book it actually was her husband.

00:01:49.810 --> 00:01:51.720
8 - the drug den.

00:01:51.720 --> 00:01:55.770
Also in twisted lip watson finds sherlock
holmes while looking for the womans husband,

00:01:55.770 --> 00:01:57.500
whos name is isa whitney.

00:01:57.500 --> 00:02:02.320
In the canon holmes was mostly a cocaine user,
but also used morphine and vistied the occasional

00:02:02.320 --> 00:02:03.750
opium den.

00:02:03.750 --> 00:02:07.640
Note that all of these drugs were perfectly
legal in late 19th century england.

00:02:07.640 --> 00:02:09.379
Now that sounds like a party.

00:02:09.379 --> 00:02:11.310
9 - Call Me Shezza.

00:02:11.310 --> 00:02:13.400
Sherlock uses it as his undercover name.

00:02:13.400 --> 00:02:16.680
In the novel his last bow holmes also uses
an undercover name.

00:02:16.680 --> 00:02:17.680
It’s Atlamont.

00:02:17.680 --> 00:02:19.409
The middle name of conan doyle’s father.

00:02:19.409 --> 00:02:20.760
Maybe shezza is sherlock’s father’s middle
name.

00:02:20.760 --> 00:02:22.700
10 - They call me wiggy.

00:02:22.700 --> 00:02:26.099
Billy wiggins is two canon characters merged
into one.

00:02:26.099 --> 00:02:28.099
Billy was the name of holmes’ page boy.

00:02:28.099 --> 00:02:32.719
He was in the valley of fear, the problem
of the thor bridge and the mazarin stone.

00:02:32.719 --> 00:02:35.250
Wiggins was the leader of the baker street
irregulars.

00:02:35.250 --> 00:02:37.830
He appeared in a study in scarlet and the
sign of four.

00:02:37.830 --> 00:02:43.390
11 - When sherlock is describing magnussen
to watson his speech ‘when you stand before

00:02:43.390 --> 00:02:46.680
the sepents of the zoo’ is lifted directly
from the book.

00:02:46.680 --> 00:02:49.959
12 - crossdressing would have been a wiser
path for you.

00:02:49.959 --> 00:02:54.749
In the canon holmes did this at least 3 times
including the adventure of black peter, the

00:02:54.749 --> 00:02:57.959
adventure of the finale problem and the adventure
of the empty house.

00:02:57.959 --> 00:03:00.700
13 - Where should we be looking?

00:03:00.700 --> 00:03:04.780
In canon holmes used to hide shag tobacco
in the toe of his persian slipper.

00:03:04.780 --> 00:03:08.129
We actually saw cumberbatch’s sherlock hide
cigarettes in the toe of a slipper during

00:03:08.129 --> 00:03:09.129
sign of three.

00:03:09.129 --> 00:03:11.359
14 - You’ve got a girlfriend.

00:03:11.359 --> 00:03:15.749
The canon holmes got engaged to Milverton’s
housemaid as part of his case.

00:03:15.749 --> 00:03:19.680
Technically janine didn’t have time to accept
sherlock’s proposal in the episode though.

00:03:19.680 --> 00:03:21.379
thanks to mary.

00:03:21.379 --> 00:03:24.269
15 - Mrs Hudson’s rap sheet.

00:03:24.269 --> 00:03:28.409
When milverton scans mrs hudson he learns
that before she was married her name was sissons,

00:03:28.409 --> 00:03:32.609
she is only a semi-reformed alcoholic and
former exotic dancer.

00:03:32.609 --> 00:03:34.450
Notice the ‘see file’ note.

00:03:34.450 --> 00:03:38.799
Later sherlock makes a similar reference and
mrs hudson accuses him of youtubing.

00:03:38.799 --> 00:03:40.260
So somewhere in the world of the show.

00:03:40.260 --> 00:03:43.849
There’s a young naked mrs hudson dancing
her way across youtube.

00:03:43.849 --> 00:03:46.529
and she has a problem with marijuana.

00:03:46.529 --> 00:03:48.970
16 - Breaking and entering.

00:03:48.970 --> 00:03:52.340
Sherlock and watson also break into milverton’s
home in the canon.

00:03:52.340 --> 00:03:54.700
17 - The east wind is coming.

00:03:54.700 --> 00:03:56.790
Holmes says this in his last bow.

00:03:56.790 --> 00:03:58.950
It means that a great change is coming.

00:03:58.950 --> 00:04:02.459
In canon it was referring to the advent of
World War 1.

00:04:02.459 --> 00:04:06.829
In the context of the show after sherlock
is shot the east wind represents death.

00:04:06.829 --> 00:04:09.799
But later in the episode the spectre of moriarty
is the east wind.

00:04:09.799 --> 00:04:11.739
Implying that series 4 will bring major changes
for the characters.

00:04:11.739 --> 00:04:12.739
18 - Redbeard.

00:04:12.739 --> 00:04:16.780
We finally learn that redbeard was sherlock’s
childhood dog who had to be put down.

00:04:16.780 --> 00:04:19.040
19 - Sussex downs.

00:04:19.040 --> 00:04:22.950
Janine sells her story to the tabloids and
buys a cottage in sussex downs.

00:04:22.950 --> 00:04:24.700
With a bee problem.

00:04:24.700 --> 00:04:29.920
In the canon, holmes retires to a farm in
sussex downs and keeps bees as a hobby.

00:04:29.920 --> 00:04:32.170
20 - Bolt Holes.

00:04:32.170 --> 00:04:37.210
Sherlock Holmes’s has 6 known bolt holes
including Parliment Hill, Camden Lock and

00:04:37.210 --> 00:04:38.210
Dagmar Court.

00:04:38.210 --> 00:04:42.700
The Blind Greenhouse in Cue Gardens and the
leaning tomb in hampstead cemetary. and Molly’s

00:04:42.700 --> 00:04:45.000
Bedroom and behind the clockface in big ben.

00:04:45.000 --> 00:04:46.590
Leinester Gardens.

00:04:46.590 --> 00:04:49.130
21 - The Lie of Linester gardens.

00:04:49.130 --> 00:04:53.060
The fake house is a reference to the story
the empty house which deals with what hides

00:04:53.060 --> 00:04:54.480
behind facades.

00:04:54.480 --> 00:04:57.190
22 - The Dynamics of Combustion.

00:04:57.190 --> 00:05:00.870
We learn that Sherlock and Mycroft’s mother
was a genius mathematician before retiring

00:05:00.870 --> 00:05:02.190
to raise a family.

00:05:02.190 --> 00:05:05.460
Thus becoming the source of their genius.

00:05:05.460 --> 00:05:07.300
23 - A.G.R.A.

00:05:07.300 --> 00:05:11.270
In canon the sign of four involves a treasure
plot originating in agra india.

00:05:11.270 --> 00:05:14.260
24 - Why do you hate him so much?

00:05:14.260 --> 00:05:18.520
Canon holmes would often take justice into
his own hands when he felt the law could not.

00:05:18.520 --> 00:05:22.120
During the milverton adventure holmes allows
milverton to be shot by another person without

00:05:22.120 --> 00:05:23.490
trying to stop her.

00:05:23.490 --> 00:05:25.520
Because he considers the killing to be justified.

00:05:25.520 --> 00:05:28.200
In the episode sherlock did it himself, but
the spirit is the same.

00:05:28.200 --> 00:05:31.140
He did what the law, represented by mycroft,
could not.

00:05:31.140 --> 00:05:36.270
25 - Sherlock Holmes dragonslayer - he says
is that what you think of me.

00:05:36.270 --> 00:05:40.560
Referring to magnussen as the dragon in question,
but before this episode was shot cumberbatch

00:05:40.560 --> 00:05:44.670
had just completed his role filming smowg
in the hobbit part 2.

00:05:44.670 --> 00:05:46.140
Also starring martin freeman.

00:05:46.140 --> 00:05:50.681
In the same conversation, mycroft says sherlock
shouldn’t take the MI6 job as he has more

00:05:50.681 --> 00:05:52.250
utility in england.

00:05:52.250 --> 00:05:53.860
Because here be dragons.

00:05:53.860 --> 00:05:56.350
Implying that he wants sherlock to take out
magnussen.

00:05:56.350 --> 00:05:58.690
26 - Let me flick your face.

00:05:58.690 --> 00:06:03.780
Steven Moffat said that Freeman and Mikkelsen
had to perform this scene several times.

00:06:03.780 --> 00:06:08.110
The two actors had to find a spot on freeman’s
face that mikkelsen could flick four hours

00:06:08.110 --> 00:06:11.210
without freeman punching mikkelsen at the
end of the day.

00:06:11.210 --> 00:06:13.810
27 - Unreliable narrator.

00:06:13.810 --> 00:06:18.060
Sherlock calls himself a high functioning
sociopath several times, but he specifically

00:06:18.060 --> 00:06:20.580
acts in the interests of his own friends.

00:06:20.580 --> 00:06:23.842
Which is completely out of character for a
true sociopath.

00:06:23.842 --> 00:06:26.190
I wonder what else he’s been lying to us
about.

00:06:26.190 --> 00:06:27.190
28.

00:06:27.190 --> 00:06:28.190
The other one.

00:06:28.190 --> 00:06:30.620
Mycroft and sherlock have an older brother
named sherrinford.

00:06:30.620 --> 00:06:35.640
he isn’t part of the actual canon, but a
noted holmes scholar theorized his existence

00:06:35.640 --> 00:06:37.650
based on facts from the books.

00:06:37.650 --> 00:06:40.770
So technically the third older brother exists
only as a theory.

00:06:40.770 --> 00:06:42.150
He was never an actual character.

00:06:42.150 --> 00:06:43.190
29 - Undercover work.

00:06:43.190 --> 00:06:48.110
In canon holmes went undercover for the english
war effort at the beginning of world war 1.

00:06:48.110 --> 00:06:49.970
30 - Did you miss me?

00:06:49.970 --> 00:06:54.370
The image shown of moriarty is of him wearing
the same suit from rickenback fall.

00:06:54.370 --> 00:06:58.270
There are a lot of theories about whether
or not it’s really him or just someone using

00:06:58.270 --> 00:06:59.270
his image.

00:06:59.270 --> 00:07:01.980
But I’m going to save all that for my series
4 predictions video.

00:07:01.980 --> 00:07:03.470
Be sure to subscribe to get it.

00:07:03.470 --> 00:07:07.230
I’ll probably do another q&amp;a video after
that just for questions about next year.

00:07:07.230 --> 00:07:13.300
Also if you saw any canon that I didn’t
mention in my video just write it in the comments.

00:07:13.300 --> 00:07:16.550
Don’t forget, I’m doing videos for the
musketeers with peter capaldi starting this

00:07:16.550 --> 00:07:17.550
sunday.

00:07:17.550 --> 00:07:22.100
Right now click here for my breakdown of episode
2 and here for my breakdown of episode 1.

00:07:22.100 --> 00:07:23.100
Thanks for watching.

00:07:23.100 --> 00:07:24.100
See you tonight.

00:07:24.100 --> 00:07:24.710
High fives!

